198
00:11:31,663 --> 00:11:35,695
an inspector has 95 percent recall and 3 percent false alarms,

199
00:11:35,715 --> 00:11:39,354
and the defect rate is 5 percent. What is its precision?

200
00:11:39,754 --> 00:11:42,513
Or true or false: at a 2 percent defect rate,

201
00:11:42,533 --> 00:11:46,218
an inspector that always says 'good' is 98 percent accurate,

202
00:11:46,238 --> 00:11:49,799
so accuracy says almost nothing about an inspection model.

203
00:11:50,199 --> 00:11:53,165
